<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A2.SS4" title="In Appendix B Implementation Details ‣ LongVideo-R1: Smart Navigation for Low-cost Long Video Understanding" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">B.4 </span>Time consumption calculation</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
