<th id="S5.T3.fig1.1.1.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_t" style="padding:-0.1pt 2.0pt;" colspan="8"><span id="S5.T3.fig1.1.1.6.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;">Leading Open-sourced MLLMs</span></th></tr>
